+## API Contracts & Envelopes
+
+### 1. Submit Visit Revision
+
+- **Endpoint**: `POST /api/v1/visits/{visit_id}/submissions`
+- **Headers**: `Idempotency-Key: <UUID>`, `Authorization: Bearer <token>`
+- **Request Envelope**:
+  ```json
+  {
+    "parent_revision_id": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
+    "plot_id": "8b2a3f10-1842-4911-a832-72124599bc01",
+    "payload": {
+      "observed_at": "2026-10-18T14:30:00Z",
+      "observers": ["worker-12", "worker-05"],
+      "species_records": [
+        {
+          "species_id": "SPAR-PAT",
+          "cover_percent": 35.5,
+          "notes": "Healthy stand along salt marsh fringe"
+        }
+      ],
+      "notes": "High tide line encroaching near east plot boundary"
+    }
+  }
+  ```
+- **Responses**:
+  - `201 Created` / `200 OK` (clean linear update or new visit):
+    ```json
